      "content": "i know... i know i should talk to someone. but what's the point? everyone who actually cared about me only cared about the version of me that was online. now that she's gone, there's just this empty shell left. it feels like the world moved on and just... deleted me. i feel like i'm just taking up space in a life that isnt even mine anymore.",
